{%- comment -%}
  The single source of the auto-renewal disclosure. Render it directly under EVERY buy button.
  Sentence: "$49 for your first jar, then $70 per month until you cancel. Cancel any time."
  Prices and the cancel wording come from Theme settings -> Offer & stock. Do not reword per page.
  Pass compact: true for the tiny sticky bar.
{%- endcomment -%}
{%- if compact -%}
<small class="sub-terms sub-terms--compact">then ${{ settings.jar_regular_price }}/mo</small>
{%- else -%}
<p class="sub-terms">${{ settings.jar_sale_price }} for your first jar, then ${{ settings.jar_regular_price }} per month until you cancel. {{ settings.cancel_text }}.</p>
{%- endif -%}
